        "TileImage": "$($repository 35b393a7-7b60-48d8-9507-7b1993daa7a9).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client, Sierra Knox, has hired us to take out Albert Noah, a former Kronstadt employee who is attempting to blackmail Knox with stolen documents relating to the Tungan Valley Incedent. Our analysis on Noah has led us to four potential co-conspirators in his scheme, who are all also now to be taken care of. You are to eliminate the five and retrieve the documents, if you are able.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
